WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.413
What does Learn leave to you?

2
00:00:01.413 --> 00:00:06.981
No post category says retirement, so the
kit treats a post tagged Retirement as one;

3
00:00:06.981 --> 00:00:11.075
Learn doesn't list the tags, so
that's marked not yet specified.

4
00:00:11.075 --> 00:00:14.796
The action-required date is
the only field where Microsoft

5
00:00:14.796 --> 00:00:18.137
says it wants action, so the
kit keeps it as Microsoft's.

6
00:00:18.137 --> 00:00:23.101
Samples show enum values in a
different case, post bodies are HTML,

7
00:00:23.101 --> 00:00:28.524
a next link is a URL the response chose,
and a post past its end still lists.

8
00:00:28.524 --> 00:00:30.550
Each gap is pinned by a test.

9
00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:34.037
The verdict: use Learn's calls
and permissions as they are,

10
00:00:34.037 --> 00:00:37.440
and build the kinds, the action
basis and the host guard.
